<title>SINGAPORE: INDIA TENDERS TO BUY OCTOBER DELIVERY KEROSENE.</title>
<headline>INDIA TENDERS TO BUY OCTOBER DELIVERY KEROSENE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued its monthly tender to buy superior kerosene for October delivery, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks 40,000-45,000 tonne cargoes for delivery to Madras or Haldia on the Indian east coast, cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis.</p>
<p>The tender closes on August 21 and is valid for one day.</p>
<p>On Monday, IOC awarded one cargo to Mobil for September delivery tender at a premium of seven cents per barrel to Singapore spot quotes on a c-and-f Madras or Haldia basis.</p>
